Written by hand for this repository on 2026-11-19 (CC0 1.0: no rights
reserved): a project file and a two-layer board holding its header, its
layers and its setup only, no item at all (no outline, no footprint, no
track), on the default A4 paper. KiCad draws the page around an empty board
when anything of its drawing sheet or page limits shows, so this is the board
tests/e2e/empty-board.spec.ts opens in a pcb frame and reads for any pixel of
the palette's drawing sheet color. files.json lists the files the e2e harness
opens. The KiCad files carry no comment, so this file holds their license.
